|---|---|---|---|
| `stream_coor_station_3_model.csv` | `merge_station_coord.R` | All stations × all dates × PNWNAmet + 2 CanESM2 runs + coords | CSV |
| `stream_coor_station_hist.csv` | `merge_station_coord.R` | Slim: PNWNAmet only | CSV |
| `stream_coor_station_rcp45.csv` | `merge_station_coord.R` | Slim: CanESM2 RCP 4.5 only | CSV |
