| `daily_bf_<target>.tif` | gridded script (Out 1) | Masked 5×5 neighbourhood baseflow, all days, LZW-compressed | GeoTIFF |
| `avg_daily_bf_<target>.parquet` | gridded script (Out 2) | Per-station per-day **top-9 mean** baseflow | Parquet |
| `year_<target>_sf_bf.csv` | gridded script (Out 3) | GEV input: annual-max streamflow + same-day baseflow covariate | CSV |

