# Run Order

```r
# Run once for each target_dataset value:
target_dataset <- "history"  ;  source("baseflow_gridded.R")
target_dataset <- "rcp45"    ;  source("baseflow_gridded.R")
target_dataset <- "rcp85"    ;  source("baseflow_gridded.R")
```

Each pass produces one `.tif`, one `.parquet`, and one `year_<target>_sf_bf.csv`. Concatenating the three `year_*_sf_bf.csv` files gives the full GEV training table (with a `target` column to distinguish them).

